## 🧪 نمونهٔ تست واحد

```csharp
[Fact]
public async Task EventBasedGateway_Should_Follow_FirstOccurredEvent()
{
    // Arrange
    var model = TestModels.EventBasedSample();
    var instance = await _engine.StartAsync(model);

    // Act
    await _engine.SignalAsync(instance, "MessageA");

    // Assert
    var state = await _repo.GetStateAsync(instance.Id);
    state.CurrentActivityId.Should().Be("TaskAfterMessageA");
}
```

